/* О программе */
"about.title" = "WashMyMac";
"about.body" = "A black screen for cleaning your MacBook.\n\n⌃⌥⌘W — start cleaning mode\n⌃⌥⌘%1$@ — hold for %2$@ s to exit\n⌃⌥⌘ — bring the hint back to the black screen\n\nThe screen goes pure black, so every smudge shows up. The keyboard, trackpad and mouse stay dead while you wipe. The mode turns itself off — set the delay in the Auto-exit menu.";

